{"review_id":"4bb9ca77-7da7-4547-a878-cad66d1c7086","app_id":"com.nautilus.realcricket","game_name":"Real Cricket™","market":"IN","review_date":"2026-02-10","star_rating":3,"review_text":"This game has graphics and potential the only problems are 1. The Shots that the computer plays on Hard and above difficulties are not available to you ans don't make sense at all 2. The multiplayer system is not properly made at all if the system can't find players it will pair you up with very high level players The system sometimes hangs and then it never progresses requiring one of the person to leave and lose many amounts of credits for no reason, game doesn't reconnect more than four times","stratum":"targeted","seed_keyword":"leave and lose","casino":false,"T_PlayingByAppointment":0,"T_DailyRewards":0,"T_Grinding":0,"T_Advertisement":0,"T_InfiniteTreadmill":0,"T_MandatoryMarathon":1,"M_PayToProgress":0,"M_IntermediateCurrency":0,"M_DeceptiveLuxury":0,"M_RecurringFee":0,"M_Gambling":0,"M_PowerCreep":0,"M_WasteAversion":0,"M_EasyToPurchase":0,"M_UIMisdirection":0,"M_NeverEndingLure":0,"S_ForcedFellowship":0,"S_FriendSpamImpersonation":0,"S_Reciprocity":0,"S_EncouragesAntiSocialBehavior":0,"S_FearOfMissingOutFOMO":0,"S_Competition":1,"P_EasyToGetHardToLose":0,"P_CompleteTheCollection":0,"P_IllusionOfControl":0,"P_AestheticManipulation":0,"P_OptimismAndFrequencyBiases":0,"P_RewardMania":0,"Tech_FragmentedDownloads":0,"none":0,"labels_str":"T: Mandatory Marathon; S: Competition","confidence":"","rule_applied":"","borderline":0,"rationale":"","flagged":0,"pass":"1","codebook_version":"v1.0","saved":1,"saved_at":"2026-08-19T09:37:18.614Z","labels":["T_MandatoryMarathon","S_Competition"]}
{"review_id":"36d84c44-4e8b-4569-9d9a-441685c3e698","app_id":"com.miniclip.cricketleague","game_name":"Cricket League","market":"IN","review_date":"2023-12-25","star_rating":2,"review_text":"Sometime the match gets stuck the bowler is just standing and the batsmen is standing nobody is moving, I thought maybe I would be experiencing bad connection or the opponent might be but after waiting for more than 5 minutes there is no sign the batmen and bowler are standing still staring into each other. At the end you have to quit and when you quit you lose your entry fees and reward. After reaching tier 7 and spending lots of time on the game. I experienced this bug/glitch.","stratum":"targeted","seed_keyword":"lose your entry fee","casino":false,"T_PlayingByAppointment":0,"T_DailyRewards":0,"T_Grinding":0,"T_Advertisement":0,"T_InfiniteTreadmill":0,"T_MandatoryMarathon":1,"M_PayToProgress":0,"M_IntermediateCurrency":0,"M_DeceptiveLuxury":0,"M_RecurringFee":0,"M_Gambling":0,"M_PowerCreep":0,"M_WasteAversion":0,"M_EasyToPurchase":0,"M_UIMisdirection":0,"M_NeverEndingLure":0,"S_ForcedFellowship":0,"S_FriendSpamImpersonation":0,"S_Reciprocity":0,"S_EncouragesAntiSocialBehavior":0,"S_FearOfMissingOutFOMO":0,"S_Competition":1,"P_EasyToGetHardToLose":0,"P_CompleteTheCollection":0,"P_IllusionOfControl":0,"P_AestheticManipulation":0,"P_OptimismAndFrequencyBiases":0,"P_RewardMania":0,"Tech_FragmentedDownloads":0,"none":0,"labels_str":"T: Mandatory Marathon; S: Competition","confidence":"","rule_applied":"","borderline":0,"rationale":"","flagged":0,"pass":"1","codebook_version":"v1.0","saved":1,"saved_at":"2026-08-19T09:37:36.110Z","labels":["T_MandatoryMarathon","S_Competition"]}
