{"review_id":"9883b5c1-8a88-4ce7-9be5-240178ca0fa6","app_id":"com.dreamgames.royalkingdom","game_name":"Royal Kingdom","market":"UK","review_date":"2026-01-12","star_rating":5,"review_text":"Not only is the game seemless, fun and exciting... even addictive, but tech support makes it PERFECT. I lost my progress when I transferred phones. I sent Support a panicked message at 1:30 am. I wasn't expecting an immediate response, let alone a human at that hour, but George was able to retrieve my account and restore my progress in less than 10 minutes. In that moment, I was the happiest person alive! GREATEST GAME EVER❣️","stratum":"targeted","seed_keyword":"lost my progress when i","casino":false,"T_PlayingByAppointment":0,"T_DailyRewards":0,"T_Grinding":0,"T_Advertisement":0,"T_InfiniteTreadmill":0,"T_MandatoryMarathon":0,"M_PayToProgress":0,"M_IntermediateCurrency":0,"M_DeceptiveLuxury":0,"M_RecurringFee":0,"M_Gambling":0,"M_PowerCreep":0,"M_WasteAversion":0,"M_EasyToPurchase":0,"M_UIMisdirection":0,"M_NeverEndingLure":0,"S_ForcedFellowship":0,"S_FriendSpamImpersonation":0,"S_Reciprocity":0,"S_EncouragesAntiSocialBehavior":0,"S_FearOfMissingOutFOMO":0,"S_Competition":0,"P_EasyToGetHardToLose":0,"P_CompleteTheCollection":0,"P_IllusionOfControl":0,"P_AestheticManipulation":0,"P_OptimismAndFrequencyBiases":0,"P_RewardMania":0,"Tech_FragmentedDownloads":0,"none":1,"labels_str":"","confidence":"","rule_applied":"","borderline":0,"rationale":"","flagged":0,"pass":"1","codebook_version":"v1.0","saved":1,"saved_at":"2026-08-19T09:37:58.338Z","labels":[]}
{"review_id":"ed219fbd-671e-4cb3-8ab0-361496b25c68","app_id":"com.screenshake.dominodreams","game_name":"Domino Dreams™","market":"UK","review_date":"2024-03-31","star_rating":1,"review_text":"This game is a cash grab you can't advance levels without spending loads of coins to pass it. The thing that annoys me also is how rng based this game is you can have one domino left on a level but rng screws you over to the point you have to redo the whole level. You can also wait an hr to get the coins necessary to play a level which is low and disappointing. Overall I'm uninstalling this it's a shame that games are becoming a paywall/ casino slot fest.","stratum":"targeted","seed_keyword":"have to redo the whole","casino":false,"T_PlayingByAppointment":1,"T_DailyRewards":0,"T_Grinding":0,"T_Advertisement":0,"T_InfiniteTreadmill":0,"T_MandatoryMarathon":0,"M_PayToProgress":1,"M_IntermediateCurrency":0,"M_DeceptiveLuxury":0,"M_RecurringFee":0,"M_Gambling":0,"M_PowerCreep":0,"M_WasteAversion":0,"M_EasyToPurchase":0,"M_UIMisdirection":0,"M_NeverEndingLure":0,"S_ForcedFellowship":0,"S_FriendSpamImpersonation":0,"S_Reciprocity":0,"S_EncouragesAntiSocialBehavior":0,"S_FearOfMissingOutFOMO":0,"S_Competition":0,"P_EasyToGetHardToLose":0,"P_CompleteTheCollection":0,"P_IllusionOfControl":0,"P_AestheticManipulation":0,"P_OptimismAndFrequencyBiases":1,"P_RewardMania":0,"Tech_FragmentedDownloads":0,"none":0,"labels_str":"T: Playing by Appointment; M: Pay to Progress; P: Optimism and Frequency Biases","confidence":"","rule_applied":"","borderline":0,"rationale":"","flagged":0,"pass":"1","codebook_version":"v1.0","saved":1,"saved_at":"2026-08-19T09:37:59.749Z","labels":["T_PlayingByAppointment","M_PayToProgress","P_OptimismAndFrequencyBiases"]}
{"review_id":"68d0ca68-5f58-4ab5-a267-cbca3bdc8129","app_id":"com.mobiin.gp","game_name":"Moba Legends: 5v5!","market":"IN","review_date":"2025-05-06","star_rating":1,"review_text":"According to me this game is worst. This give you a high penalty for quitting the game or network issue or solo survival.You always play with coordination otherwise you will be reported. I can not play ranked match for 2 weaks for this creadit score. Some one reported me and my credit score decrease by 3 and one day you only recover your creadit score by 3 . And this way you can not play ranked match anymore .You always play classic match forever.This game may increase their recovery of creadit","stratum":"targeted","seed_keyword":"penalty for quitting","casino":false,"T_PlayingByAppointment":0,"T_DailyRewards":0,"T_Grinding":0,"T_Advertisement":0,"T_InfiniteTreadmill":0,"T_MandatoryMarathon":1,"M_PayToProgress":0,"M_IntermediateCurrency":0,"M_DeceptiveLuxury":0,"M_RecurringFee":0,"M_Gambling":0,"M_PowerCreep":0,"M_WasteAversion":0,"M_EasyToPurchase":0,"M_UIMisdirection":0,"M_NeverEndingLure":0,"S_ForcedFellowship":0,"S_FriendSpamImpersonation":0,"S_Reciprocity":0,"S_EncouragesAntiSocialBehavior":0,"S_FearOfMissingOutFOMO":0,"S_Competition":1,"P_EasyToGetHardToLose":0,"P_CompleteTheCollection":0,"P_IllusionOfControl":0,"P_AestheticManipulation":0,"P_OptimismAndFrequencyBiases":0,"P_RewardMania":0,"Tech_FragmentedDownloads":0,"none":0,"labels_str":"T: Mandatory Marathon; S: Competition","confidence":"","rule_applied":"","borderline":0,"rationale":"","flagged":0,"pass":"1","codebook_version":"v1.0","saved":1,"saved_at":"2026-08-19T09:38:01.942Z","labels":["T_MandatoryMarathon","S_Competition"]}
{"review_id":"443ba104-8abc-48c7-b8a7-b875ec52b05b","app_id":"com.activision.callofduty.shooter","game_name":"Call of Duty®: Mobile","market":"IN","review_date":"2020-04-19","star_rating":5,"review_text":"I'm actually super impressed. It really is the next best thing to playing on the console! I see a lot of reviews about it lagging and glitching...I would recommend it, but I am so angry. Literally at least once every day, the game just force quits itself in the middle of a match and it has cost me so many wins, and to add insult to injury....I get penalized for leaving matches early on top of that and I wasn't even the one who quit the match!","stratum":"targeted","seed_keyword":"penalized for leaving","casino":false,"T_PlayingByAppointment":0,"T_DailyRewards":0,"T_Grinding":0,"T_Advertisement":0,"T_InfiniteTreadmill":0,"T_MandatoryMarathon":1,"M_PayToProgress":0,"M_IntermediateCurrency":0,"M_DeceptiveLuxury":0,"M_RecurringFee":0,"M_Gambling":0,"M_PowerCreep":0,"M_WasteAversion":0,"M_EasyToPurchase":0,"M_UIMisdirection":0,"M_NeverEndingLure":0,"S_ForcedFellowship":0,"S_FriendSpamImpersonation":0,"S_Reciprocity":0,"S_EncouragesAntiSocialBehavior":0,"S_FearOfMissingOutFOMO":0,"S_Competition":0,"P_EasyToGetHardToLose":0,"P_CompleteTheCollection":0,"P_IllusionOfControl":0,"P_AestheticManipulation":0,"P_OptimismAndFrequencyBiases":0,"P_RewardMania":0,"Tech_FragmentedDownloads":0,"none":0,"labels_str":"T: Mandatory Marathon","confidence":"","rule_applied":"","borderline":0,"rationale":"","flagged":0,"pass":"1","codebook_version":"v1.0","saved":1,"saved_at":"2026-08-19T09:38:02.772Z","labels":["T_MandatoryMarathon"]}
