{"review_id":"048eb77f-83b8-497d-b64f-46e5c79cbb1d","app_id":"com.funtomic.matchmasters","game_name":"Match Masters","market":"UK","review_date":"2023-11-20","star_rating":1,"review_text":"It's a fun game, but the frustration takes the fun out of it. I have watched opponents keep playing after the timer runs out, I lose my paid boosters within 15 minutes of paying for them because the game lags and freezes until the timer runs out. I can play all day and flawlessly with free boosters but as soon as I play with a paid booster the ridiculousness starts. Sorry Sia, customer service is a joke. It's never the games fault, ever. It's the wifi, or my phone. It is so frustrating.","stratum":"targeted","seed_keyword":"until the timer runs out","casino":false,"T_PlayingByAppointment":0,"T_DailyRewards":0,"T_Grinding":0,"T_Advertisement":0,"T_InfiniteTreadmill":0,"T_MandatoryMarathon":0,"M_PayToProgress":0,"M_IntermediateCurrency":0,"M_DeceptiveLuxury":0,"M_RecurringFee":0,"M_Gambling":0,"M_PowerCreep":0,"M_WasteAversion":0,"M_EasyToPurchase":0,"M_UIMisdirection":0,"M_NeverEndingLure":0,"S_ForcedFellowship":0,"S_FriendSpamImpersonation":0,"S_Reciprocity":0,"S_EncouragesAntiSocialBehavior":0,"S_FearOfMissingOutFOMO":0,"S_Competition":1,"P_EasyToGetHardToLose":0,"P_CompleteTheCollection":0,"P_IllusionOfControl":0,"P_AestheticManipulation":0,"P_OptimismAndFrequencyBiases":0,"P_RewardMania":0,"Tech_FragmentedDownloads":0,"none":0,"labels_str":"S: Competition","confidence":"","rule_applied":"","borderline":0,"rationale":"","flagged":0,"pass":"1","codebook_version":"v1.0","saved":1,"saved_at":"2026-08-19T09:38:10.726Z","labels":["S_Competition"]}
{"review_id":"fe4ad63c-0bee-4c2e-814f-1e4f46f14d3d","app_id":"com.playrix.township","game_name":"Township","market":"UK","review_date":"2026-05-26","star_rating":4,"review_text":"Please have a feature where you can edit plans for your town and then if you're not finished yet, you can temporarily save it as a draft so you can continue editing it later. It doesn't have to be usable. Just a draft design that you can continue editing later. Editing the plan of the town is very time consuming and it's unfortunate that you have to put all buildings in place first before you can save it and continue. I want to edit my town like Im an urban planner and it takes time of planning.","stratum":"targeted","seed_keyword":"before you can save","casino":false,"T_PlayingByAppointment":0,"T_DailyRewards":0,"T_Grinding":0,"T_Advertisement":0,"T_InfiniteTreadmill":0,"T_MandatoryMarathon":1,"M_PayToProgress":0,"M_IntermediateCurrency":0,"M_DeceptiveLuxury":0,"M_RecurringFee":0,"M_Gambling":0,"M_PowerCreep":0,"M_WasteAversion":0,"M_EasyToPurchase":0,"M_UIMisdirection":0,"M_NeverEndingLure":0,"S_ForcedFellowship":0,"S_FriendSpamImpersonation":0,"S_Reciprocity":0,"S_EncouragesAntiSocialBehavior":0,"S_FearOfMissingOutFOMO":0,"S_Competition":0,"P_EasyToGetHardToLose":0,"P_CompleteTheCollection":0,"P_IllusionOfControl":0,"P_AestheticManipulation":0,"P_OptimismAndFrequencyBiases":0,"P_RewardMania":0,"Tech_FragmentedDownloads":0,"none":0,"labels_str":"T: Mandatory Marathon","confidence":"","rule_applied":"","borderline":0,"rationale":"","flagged":0,"pass":"1","codebook_version":"v1.0","saved":1,"saved_at":"2026-08-19T09:38:10.903Z","labels":["T_MandatoryMarathon"]}
