{"review_id":"4c023e35-cc35-4b5a-a2a2-f18b5eb2818e","app_id":"com.fun.lastwar.gp","game_name":"Last War:Survival Game","market":"UK","review_date":"2024-07-02","star_rating":1,"review_text":"Outdated technology. This game crashes far too much to progress thru it. When it does crash you start over from the beginning. It only saves at the end of a level so you end up starting it over. The idea of the game is on but fails to deliver","stratum":"targeted","seed_keyword":"saves at the end of","casino":false,"T_PlayingByAppointment":0,"T_DailyRewards":0,"T_Grinding":0,"T_Advertisement":0,"T_InfiniteTreadmill":0,"T_MandatoryMarathon":1,"M_PayToProgress":0,"M_IntermediateCurrency":0,"M_DeceptiveLuxury":0,"M_RecurringFee":0,"M_Gambling":0,"M_PowerCreep":0,"M_WasteAversion":0,"M_EasyToPurchase":0,"M_UIMisdirection":0,"M_NeverEndingLure":0,"S_ForcedFellowship":0,"S_FriendSpamImpersonation":0,"S_Reciprocity":0,"S_EncouragesAntiSocialBehavior":0,"S_FearOfMissingOutFOMO":0,"S_Competition":0,"P_EasyToGetHardToLose":0,"P_CompleteTheCollection":0,"P_IllusionOfControl":0,"P_AestheticManipulation":0,"P_OptimismAndFrequencyBiases":0,"P_RewardMania":0,"Tech_FragmentedDownloads":0,"none":0,"labels_str":"T: Mandatory Marathon","confidence":"","rule_applied":"","borderline":0,"rationale":"","flagged":0,"pass":"1","codebook_version":"v1.0","saved":1,"saved_at":"2026-08-19T09:38:11.603Z","labels":["T_MandatoryMarathon"]}
{"review_id":"8cdcc4f0-037c-4e77-9994-e70e7331ca39","app_id":"com.moonactive.coinmaster","game_name":"Coin Master","market":"UK","review_date":"2020-07-08","star_rating":1,"review_text":"There seems to be a loop hole in the system. When attacking and if I choose a particular village it will say connection error and I click reconnect but at the end I have to always close the app. Which means my spins are gone and I don't also get the reward for attacking. Everytime I attack this particular village again it will say the same thing ( I have screenshot) and cycle begins again. Mind you I have full functioning wifi, app is up to date etc ...","stratum":"targeted","seed_keyword":"reward for attacking","casino":false,"T_PlayingByAppointment":0,"T_DailyRewards":0,"T_Grinding":0,"T_Advertisement":0,"T_InfiniteTreadmill":0,"T_MandatoryMarathon":1,"M_PayToProgress":0,"M_IntermediateCurrency":0,"M_DeceptiveLuxury":0,"M_RecurringFee":0,"M_Gambling":0,"M_PowerCreep":0,"M_WasteAversion":0,"M_EasyToPurchase":0,"M_UIMisdirection":0,"M_NeverEndingLure":0,"S_ForcedFellowship":0,"S_FriendSpamImpersonation":0,"S_Reciprocity":0,"S_EncouragesAntiSocialBehavior":0,"S_FearOfMissingOutFOMO":0,"S_Competition":1,"P_EasyToGetHardToLose":0,"P_CompleteTheCollection":0,"P_IllusionOfControl":0,"P_AestheticManipulation":0,"P_OptimismAndFrequencyBiases":0,"P_RewardMania":0,"Tech_FragmentedDownloads":0,"none":0,"labels_str":"T: Mandatory Marathon; S: Competition","confidence":"","rule_applied":"","borderline":0,"rationale":"","flagged":0,"pass":"1","codebook_version":"v1.0","saved":1,"saved_at":"2026-08-19T09:38:11.769Z","labels":["T_MandatoryMarathon","S_Competition"]}
{"review_id":"e10ae1dc-9999-4c7e-9318-cd6502d502ca","app_id":"com.fun.lastwar.gp","game_name":"Last War:Survival Game","market":"UK","review_date":"2024-02-10","star_rating":2,"review_text":"Game play is primarily about building up a base. You are encouraged to join an alliance nd help the team. Different than the ads, not bad just different. Unfortunately, a few things ruin the experience. After a few levels, game play really slows down. It takes hours or days to upgrade buildings and research new tech. The rules encourage bullying behavior. Stronger players are rewarded for attacking weaker ones. Could be a much better game with as few adjustments.","stratum":"targeted","seed_keyword":"rewarded for attacking","casino":false,"T_PlayingByAppointment":1,"T_DailyRewards":0,"T_Grinding":0,"T_Advertisement":0,"T_InfiniteTreadmill":0,"T_MandatoryMarathon":0,"M_PayToProgress":0,"M_IntermediateCurrency":0,"M_DeceptiveLuxury":0,"M_RecurringFee":0,"M_Gambling":0,"M_PowerCreep":0,"M_WasteAversion":0,"M_EasyToPurchase":0,"M_UIMisdirection":0,"M_NeverEndingLure":0,"S_ForcedFellowship":0,"S_FriendSpamImpersonation":0,"S_Reciprocity":0,"S_EncouragesAntiSocialBehavior":1,"S_FearOfMissingOutFOMO":0,"S_Competition":1,"P_EasyToGetHardToLose":0,"P_CompleteTheCollection":0,"P_IllusionOfControl":0,"P_AestheticManipulation":0,"P_OptimismAndFrequencyBiases":0,"P_RewardMania":0,"Tech_FragmentedDownloads":0,"none":0,"labels_str":"T: Playing by Appointment; S: Encourages Anti-Social Behavior; S: Competition","confidence":"","rule_applied":"","borderline":0,"rationale":"","flagged":0,"pass":"1","codebook_version":"v1.0","saved":1,"saved_at":"2026-08-19T09:38:11.946Z","labels":["T_PlayingByAppointment","S_EncouragesAntiSocialBehavior","S_Competition"]}
{"review_id":"84bbc363-d55a-4cf1-a557-c61ed7ab82bc","app_id":"com.fun.lastwar.gp","game_name":"Last War:Survival Game","market":"UK","review_date":"2024-01-28","star_rating":3,"review_text":"Once you get past building the city block stage, it gets kinda boring. It's just grinding resources trying not to get raided so you can level up to have a few more attempts at the left right scroller game. The advertisement that's really becomes not that great. The bigger alliances all just attack the smaller alliances and take their resources. I dedicated some time to this game and to my alliances and am disappointed with current status.","stratum":"targeted","seed_keyword":"take their resources","casino":false,"T_PlayingByAppointment":0,"T_DailyRewards":0,"T_Grinding":1,"T_Advertisement":0,"T_InfiniteTreadmill":0,"T_MandatoryMarathon":0,"M_PayToProgress":0,"M_IntermediateCurrency":0,"M_DeceptiveLuxury":0,"M_RecurringFee":0,"M_Gambling":0,"M_PowerCreep":0,"M_WasteAversion":0,"M_EasyToPurchase":0,"M_UIMisdirection":0,"M_NeverEndingLure":0,"S_ForcedFellowship":0,"S_FriendSpamImpersonation":0,"S_Reciprocity":0,"S_EncouragesAntiSocialBehavior":1,"S_FearOfMissingOutFOMO":0,"S_Competition":1,"P_EasyToGetHardToLose":0,"P_CompleteTheCollection":0,"P_IllusionOfControl":0,"P_AestheticManipulation":0,"P_OptimismAndFrequencyBiases":0,"P_RewardMania":0,"Tech_FragmentedDownloads":0,"none":0,"labels_str":"T: Grinding; S: Encourages Anti-Social Behavior; S: Competition","confidence":"","rule_applied":"","borderline":0,"rationale":"","flagged":0,"pass":"1","codebook_version":"v1.0","saved":1,"saved_at":"2026-08-19T09:38:12.108Z","labels":["T_Grinding","S_EncouragesAntiSocialBehavior","S_Competition"]}
{"review_id":"59829834-0e30-4af1-b9e3-62adf2ed0cca","app_id":"com.run.tower.defense","game_name":"Kingshot","market":"UK","review_date":"2025-11-25","star_rating":1,"review_text":"Fake ads lured me to download this game. It's a direct clone of Whiteout Survival. You build a town and get attacked by other players who steal your resources. Or you steal theirs. Extremely Pay To Win where there's zero chance at fighting or defending against people who pour tons of money into the game. Gets boring, real quick. The ad shows no actual game play.","stratum":"targeted","seed_keyword":"steal their","casino":false,"T_PlayingByAppointment":0,"T_DailyRewards":0,"T_Grinding":0,"T_Advertisement":0,"T_InfiniteTreadmill":0,"T_MandatoryMarathon":0,"M_PayToProgress":1,"M_IntermediateCurrency":0,"M_DeceptiveLuxury":0,"M_RecurringFee":0,"M_Gambling":0,"M_PowerCreep":0,"M_WasteAversion":0,"M_EasyToPurchase":0,"M_UIMisdirection":0,"M_NeverEndingLure":0,"S_ForcedFellowship":0,"S_FriendSpamImpersonation":0,"S_Reciprocity":0,"S_EncouragesAntiSocialBehavior":0,"S_FearOfMissingOutFOMO":0,"S_Competition":1,"P_EasyToGetHardToLose":0,"P_CompleteTheCollection":0,"P_IllusionOfControl":0,"P_AestheticManipulation":0,"P_OptimismAndFrequencyBiases":0,"P_RewardMania":0,"Tech_FragmentedDownloads":0,"none":0,"labels_str":"M: Pay to Progress; S: Competition","confidence":"","rule_applied":"","borderline":0,"rationale":"","flagged":0,"pass":"1","codebook_version":"v1.0","saved":1,"saved_at":"2026-08-19T09:38:12.278Z","labels":["M_PayToProgress","S_Competition"]}
