{"review_id":"6142e544-7b25-4fb4-9954-571ed1989d62","app_id":"air.com.buffalo_studios.newflashbingo","game_name":"Bingo Blitz™️ - Bingo Games","market":"UK","review_date":"2026-05-12","star_rating":2,"review_text":"I liked it at first until it started requiring $$. *This is a P2W game* this game wants you to spend money to win. Their bingo cards cost a crazy amount to buy and the only way to win is to purchase 4 cards per game or don't bother. One min. you have 2,000 B coins to spend and you play one round that costs 300+ coins (Legendary Cards) and several games later coins are ALL GONE! It's not worth it because the game only lasts for 1 min. P2W P2P GAME. NOT F2P! Y'all need to fix the cost & system","stratum":"targeted","seed_keyword":"only way to win is to","casino":true,"T_PlayingByAppointment":0,"T_DailyRewards":0,"T_Grinding":0,"T_Advertisement":0,"T_InfiniteTreadmill":0,"T_MandatoryMarathon":0,"M_PayToProgress":1,"M_IntermediateCurrency":0,"M_DeceptiveLuxury":0,"M_RecurringFee":0,"M_Gambling":1,"M_PowerCreep":0,"M_WasteAversion":0,"M_EasyToPurchase":0,"M_UIMisdirection":0,"M_NeverEndingLure":0,"S_ForcedFellowship":0,"S_FriendSpamImpersonation":0,"S_Reciprocity":0,"S_EncouragesAntiSocialBehavior":0,"S_FearOfMissingOutFOMO":0,"S_Competition":0,"P_EasyToGetHardToLose":0,"P_CompleteTheCollection":0,"P_IllusionOfControl":0,"P_AestheticManipulation":0,"P_OptimismAndFrequencyBiases":0,"P_RewardMania":0,"Tech_FragmentedDownloads":0,"none":0,"labels_str":"M: Pay to Progress; M: Gambling","confidence":"","rule_applied":"","borderline":0,"rationale":"","flagged":0,"pass":"1","codebook_version":"v1.0","saved":1,"saved_at":"2026-08-19T09:44:32.300Z","labels":["M_PayToProgress","M_Gambling"]}
{"review_id":"2f50b132-9762-4f48-ae35-487f414aa41a","app_id":"com.scopely.monopolygo","game_name":"MONOPOLY GO!","market":"UK","review_date":"2024-07-04","star_rating":1,"review_text":"Okay so I started playing in October of 2023. In the beginning, it was a fun game. Over time, I started to see the real issues in the game. 1. Most other players live by the motto you have to cheat to beat the game system and I am starting to feel they are right! 2. Events have become a joke. Peg-E is a total waste the new race car game is even worse! 3. Way to many gold duplicates! 4. Not enough trades a day! 5. Not enough dice.I could keep going but I only have 500 spaces, and I am at my limit","stratum":"targeted","seed_keyword":"you have to cheat to","casino":false,"T_PlayingByAppointment":0,"T_DailyRewards":0,"T_Grinding":0,"T_Advertisement":0,"T_InfiniteTreadmill":0,"T_MandatoryMarathon":0,"M_PayToProgress":0,"M_IntermediateCurrency":0,"M_DeceptiveLuxury":0,"M_RecurringFee":0,"M_Gambling":0,"M_PowerCreep":0,"M_WasteAversion":0,"M_EasyToPurchase":0,"M_UIMisdirection":0,"M_NeverEndingLure":0,"S_ForcedFellowship":0,"S_FriendSpamImpersonation":0,"S_Reciprocity":1,"S_EncouragesAntiSocialBehavior":1,"S_FearOfMissingOutFOMO":0,"S_Competition":0,"P_EasyToGetHardToLose":0,"P_CompleteTheCollection":0,"P_IllusionOfControl":0,"P_AestheticManipulation":0,"P_OptimismAndFrequencyBiases":0,"P_RewardMania":0,"Tech_FragmentedDownloads":0,"none":0,"labels_str":"S: Reciprocity; S: Encourages Anti-Social Behavior","confidence":"","rule_applied":"","borderline":0,"rationale":"","flagged":0,"pass":"1","codebook_version":"v1.0","saved":1,"saved_at":"2026-08-19T09:45:32.269Z","labels":["S_Reciprocity","S_EncouragesAntiSocialBehavior"]}
{"review_id":"d6007c7b-f899-47d9-8c66-335a1e5f24ca","app_id":"com.moonactive.coinmaster","game_name":"Coin Master","market":"UK","review_date":"2023-10-15","star_rating":2,"review_text":"Google, increase character limit for reviews! Has potential, but I don't spend money unless I truly want to support the developers and see purchases that give actual gameplay value (I don't here). So please stop shoving literally every purchase/invite bonus in my face every time I run out of spins. Also, please let your game save progress on Google Play Games. I don't use Facebook because it's pretty much worthless nowadays. Fun elements, but ultimately not worth your time in its current state.","stratum":"targeted","seed_keyword":"invite bonus","casino":false,"T_PlayingByAppointment":0,"T_DailyRewards":0,"T_Grinding":0,"T_Advertisement":0,"T_InfiniteTreadmill":0,"T_MandatoryMarathon":0,"M_PayToProgress":0,"M_IntermediateCurrency":0,"M_DeceptiveLuxury":0,"M_RecurringFee":0,"M_Gambling":0,"M_PowerCreep":0,"M_WasteAversion":0,"M_EasyToPurchase":1,"M_UIMisdirection":0,"M_NeverEndingLure":0,"S_ForcedFellowship":1,"S_FriendSpamImpersonation":0,"S_Reciprocity":0,"S_EncouragesAntiSocialBehavior":0,"S_FearOfMissingOutFOMO":0,"S_Competition":0,"P_EasyToGetHardToLose":0,"P_CompleteTheCollection":0,"P_IllusionOfControl":0,"P_AestheticManipulation":0,"P_OptimismAndFrequencyBiases":0,"P_RewardMania":0,"Tech_FragmentedDownloads":0,"none":0,"labels_str":"M: Easy to Purchase; S: Forced Fellowship","confidence":"","rule_applied":"","borderline":0,"rationale":"","flagged":0,"pass":"1","codebook_version":"v1.0","saved":1,"saved_at":"2026-08-19T09:46:37.409Z","labels":["M_EasyToPurchase","S_ForcedFellowship"]}
