{"review_id":"77357e2c-603b-402a-9994-5f62c18f5f39","app_id":"com.moonactive.coinmaster","game_name":"Coin Master","market":"US","review_date":"2019-11-07","star_rating":1,"review_text":"Too much time in between spins, losing interest in game very quickly, don't want to use anymore time or money, you don't get the reward for inviting friends to join, too many thing popping up when opening game and when you use all your spins and never get cards from chest that you actually need far to many of the same cards over and over","stratum":"targeted","seed_keyword":"reward for inviting","casino":false,"T_PlayingByAppointment":1,"T_DailyRewards":0,"T_Grinding":0,"T_Advertisement":0,"T_InfiniteTreadmill":0,"T_MandatoryMarathon":0,"M_PayToProgress":0,"M_IntermediateCurrency":0,"M_DeceptiveLuxury":0,"M_RecurringFee":0,"M_Gambling":0,"M_PowerCreep":0,"M_WasteAversion":0,"M_EasyToPurchase":0,"M_UIMisdirection":0,"M_NeverEndingLure":0,"S_ForcedFellowship":1,"S_FriendSpamImpersonation":0,"S_Reciprocity":0,"S_EncouragesAntiSocialBehavior":0,"S_FearOfMissingOutFOMO":0,"S_Competition":0,"P_EasyToGetHardToLose":0,"P_CompleteTheCollection":1,"P_IllusionOfControl":0,"P_AestheticManipulation":0,"P_OptimismAndFrequencyBiases":0,"P_RewardMania":1,"Tech_FragmentedDownloads":0,"none":0,"labels_str":"T: Playing by Appointment; S: Forced Fellowship; P: Complete the Collection; P: Reward Mania","confidence":"","rule_applied":"","borderline":0,"rationale":"","flagged":0,"pass":"1","codebook_version":"v1.0","saved":1,"saved_at":"2026-08-19T09:47:08.220Z","labels":["T_PlayingByAppointment","S_ForcedFellowship","P_CompleteTheCollection","P_RewardMania"]}
{"review_id":"5e6a5625-5291-4f0e-897c-1b63c1a26494","app_id":"com.scopely.monopolygo","game_name":"MONOPOLY GO!","market":"US","review_date":"2023-09-29","star_rating":1,"review_text":"I loved this game until the new season started. Suddenly I get no rewards for inviting friends and getting them to join facebook. I am struggling to get dices and when I finally had more than 500 dices and played max bet, absolutely NO LUCK! No Shut downs and no bank heists. Stickers are duplicates all the way... And today. Well, I cannot log in to the game at all. It keeps giving me an internet connection error which is absolute nonsense. I have connected to 3 different wifi connections. BS!!😡","stratum":"targeted","seed_keyword":"rewards for inviting","casino":false,"T_PlayingByAppointment":0,"T_DailyRewards":0,"T_Grinding":0,"T_Advertisement":0,"T_InfiniteTreadmill":0,"T_MandatoryMarathon":0,"M_PayToProgress":0,"M_IntermediateCurrency":0,"M_DeceptiveLuxury":0,"M_RecurringFee":0,"M_Gambling":1,"M_PowerCreep":0,"M_WasteAversion":0,"M_EasyToPurchase":0,"M_UIMisdirection":0,"M_NeverEndingLure":0,"S_ForcedFellowship":1,"S_FriendSpamImpersonation":0,"S_Reciprocity":0,"S_EncouragesAntiSocialBehavior":0,"S_FearOfMissingOutFOMO":0,"S_Competition":0,"P_EasyToGetHardToLose":0,"P_CompleteTheCollection":1,"P_IllusionOfControl":0,"P_AestheticManipulation":0,"P_OptimismAndFrequencyBiases":0,"P_RewardMania":1,"Tech_FragmentedDownloads":0,"none":0,"labels_str":"M: Gambling; S: Forced Fellowship; P: Complete the Collection; P: Reward Mania","confidence":"","rule_applied":"","borderline":0,"rationale":"","flagged":0,"pass":"1","codebook_version":"v1.0","saved":1,"saved_at":"2026-08-19T09:47:48.411Z","labels":["M_Gambling","S_ForcedFellowship","P_CompleteTheCollection","P_RewardMania"]}
{"review_id":"69146d72-421f-4f67-9510-3839238d4276","app_id":"com.playrix.township","game_name":"Township","market":"UK","review_date":"2023-03-17","star_rating":3,"review_text":"Hi, This game is good. But I'm very disappointed because of your team support. My friend lost his town and asked help to your customer care and they asked details to backup the game progress. And asked friend invite code. We send the invite code and all other details. And they dumped my town progress to his device. At a time we can't play together. As that device is having my account. So I'm going to uninstall this game. Very bad experience.","stratum":"targeted","seed_keyword":"invite code","casino":false,"T_PlayingByAppointment":0,"T_DailyRewards":0,"T_Grinding":0,"T_Advertisement":0,"T_InfiniteTreadmill":0,"T_MandatoryMarathon":0,"M_PayToProgress":0,"M_IntermediateCurrency":0,"M_DeceptiveLuxury":0,"M_RecurringFee":0,"M_Gambling":0,"M_PowerCreep":0,"M_WasteAversion":0,"M_EasyToPurchase":0,"M_UIMisdirection":0,"M_NeverEndingLure":0,"S_ForcedFellowship":0,"S_FriendSpamImpersonation":0,"S_Reciprocity":0,"S_EncouragesAntiSocialBehavior":0,"S_FearOfMissingOutFOMO":0,"S_Competition":0,"P_EasyToGetHardToLose":0,"P_CompleteTheCollection":0,"P_IllusionOfControl":0,"P_AestheticManipulation":0,"P_OptimismAndFrequencyBiases":0,"P_RewardMania":0,"Tech_FragmentedDownloads":0,"none":1,"labels_str":"","confidence":"","rule_applied":"","borderline":0,"rationale":"","flagged":0,"pass":"1","codebook_version":"v1.0","saved":1,"saved_at":"2026-08-19T09:48:01.019Z","labels":[]}
{"review_id":"57add346-8b93-4249-be50-1a39331cf79b","app_id":"com.plarium.raidlegends","game_name":"RAID: Shadow Legends","market":"UK","review_date":"2020-06-25","star_rating":2,"review_text":"These are my views of the game after playing for almost a day. I didnt make a single purchase but got a free champion and silver from a referral. Pros: Easy to learn the controls and layout of the game, nice story line, easy combat system, no lag, nice champion designs and gameplay. Cons: Every single time you log in you are bombarded with pop ads advertising \"special\" or \"limited time\" deals, once your champions hit level 30 it becomes a horrible grind, p2p is the best way to win this game.","stratum":"targeted","seed_keyword":"referral","casino":false,"T_PlayingByAppointment":0,"T_DailyRewards":0,"T_Grinding":0,"T_Advertisement":0,"T_InfiniteTreadmill":0,"T_MandatoryMarathon":0,"M_PayToProgress":1,"M_IntermediateCurrency":0,"M_DeceptiveLuxury":1,"M_RecurringFee":0,"M_Gambling":0,"M_PowerCreep":0,"M_WasteAversion":0,"M_EasyToPurchase":1,"M_UIMisdirection":0,"M_NeverEndingLure":0,"S_ForcedFellowship":1,"S_FriendSpamImpersonation":0,"S_Reciprocity":0,"S_EncouragesAntiSocialBehavior":0,"S_FearOfMissingOutFOMO":0,"S_Competition":0,"P_EasyToGetHardToLose":0,"P_CompleteTheCollection":0,"P_IllusionOfControl":0,"P_AestheticManipulation":0,"P_OptimismAndFrequencyBiases":0,"P_RewardMania":0,"Tech_FragmentedDownloads":0,"none":0,"labels_str":"M: Pay to Progress; M: Deceptive Luxury; M: Easy to Purchase; S: Forced Fellowship","confidence":"","rule_applied":"","borderline":0,"rationale":"","flagged":0,"pass":"1","codebook_version":"v1.0","saved":1,"saved_at":"2026-08-19T09:49:29.331Z","labels":["M_PayToProgress","M_DeceptiveLuxury","M_EasyToPurchase","S_ForcedFellowship"]}
{"review_id":"71657164-4657-45aa-aa08-4103595d0bc0","app_id":"com.scopely.monopolygo","game_name":"MONOPOLY GO!","market":"US","review_date":"2023-08-20","star_rating":3,"review_text":"Very addictive to begin with but the game is ultimately flawed, your expected to pay if you want to win any events or even come in the top 10!! I am now over 2000 score and it feels like I never have any dice, I login after 8 hours and will be lucky to have 60+ dice which you cannot do anything with! It's good but could use some late game balance changes to make it more enjoyable. Also contacted support about my refer a friend hasn't worked but no reply in 3 weeks...","stratum":"targeted","seed_keyword":"refer a friend","casino":false,"T_PlayingByAppointment":1,"T_DailyRewards":0,"T_Grinding":0,"T_Advertisement":0,"T_InfiniteTreadmill":0,"T_MandatoryMarathon":0,"M_PayToProgress":1,"M_IntermediateCurrency":0,"M_DeceptiveLuxury":0,"M_RecurringFee":0,"M_Gambling":0,"M_PowerCreep":0,"M_WasteAversion":0,"M_EasyToPurchase":0,"M_UIMisdirection":0,"M_NeverEndingLure":0,"S_ForcedFellowship":1,"S_FriendSpamImpersonation":0,"S_Reciprocity":0,"S_EncouragesAntiSocialBehavior":0,"S_FearOfMissingOutFOMO":0,"S_Competition":1,"P_EasyToGetHardToLose":0,"P_CompleteTheCollection":0,"P_IllusionOfControl":0,"P_AestheticManipulation":0,"P_OptimismAndFrequencyBiases":0,"P_RewardMania":0,"Tech_FragmentedDownloads":0,"none":0,"labels_str":"T: Playing by Appointment; M: Pay to Progress; S: Forced Fellowship; S: Competition","confidence":"","rule_applied":"","borderline":0,"rationale":"","flagged":0,"pass":"1","codebook_version":"v1.0","saved":1,"saved_at":"2026-08-19T09:49:59.854Z","labels":["T_PlayingByAppointment","M_PayToProgress","S_ForcedFellowship","S_Competition"]}
